cff-version: 1.2.0
message: If you use Pocketwind, please cite it as below.
title: "Pocketwind: a local browser wind tunnel with a WebGPU lattice Boltzmann solver"
type: software
authors:
  - family-names: Jawad
    given-names: Intesar
version: 0.1.0
license: MIT
repository-code: "https://github.com/intesarjawad/pocketwind"
abstract: >-
  Pocketwind is a local browser wind-tunnel prototype that voxelizes a mesh and runs a
  WebGPU lattice Boltzmann solver. Drag is validated for a sphere in one laminar-flow case.
keywords:
  - wind tunnel
  - lattice Boltzmann
  - WebGPU
  - computational fluid dynamics
